"login": "ygratz", "id": 127649038, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5vFDg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127649038?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygratz", "html_url": "https://github.com/ygratz", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygratz/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygratz/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygratz/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygratz/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygratz/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygratz/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygratz/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygratz/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygratz/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-11-15T09:41:50Z", "updated_at": "2023-11-15T09:41:50Z", "body": "Hi,\r\nI followed your advise and it works with MavlinkPassthrough.\r\nI do have a problem with: mavlink_msg_ekf_status_report.h. This h file is missing.\r\n\r\nWhen looking at: https://github.com/mavlink/c_library_v2/ most of the messages are at /common.\r\nThe mavlink_msg_ekf_status_report.h is at /ardupilotmega.\r\nIt seems MAVSDK does not include it.\r\n\r\nWhat would be the most correct way to add this library as well? is there a way to configure MAVSDK to include it? \r\nThanks\r\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1812113189/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1812169641", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2178#issuecomment-1812169641", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2178", "id": 1812169641, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5sA4Op", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-11-15T10:18:05Z", "updated_at": "2023-11-15T10:18:05Z", "body": "It should work if you build MAVSDK with /ardupilotmega, given that [it does include /common](https://github.com/mavlink/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/ardupilotmega.xml#L3) (that MAVSDK needs).\r\n\r\nIn the MAVSDK superbuild, when building mavlink, there is a [`-DMAVLINK_DIALECT`](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/third_party/mavlink/CMakeLists.txt#L9) which is [set by the superbuild](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/CMakeLists.txt#L8).\r\n\r\nSo it should work if you make a clean build of MAVSDK, and in the configure step (the first one, which has something like `-Bbuild/default` in it), add `-DMAVLINK_DIALECT=ardupilotmega`.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {